{"ID":"20240513082942-xjsulfc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082942-xjsulfc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082942-xjsulfc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180042-xa0532o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180042-xa0532o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:857,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180042-xa0532o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:834,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:1114\u0026#125;","title":"349","type":"doc","updated":"20240515114912"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513180042-xa0532o","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 894px;","id":"20240513180042-xa0532o","updated":"20240515114912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"243-3 W, P"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"54歲 / 瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5 /22 / 2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者得乳癌，經由西醫治療，癌細胞已轉移至肺及骨。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後，睡好轉，只有一次醒來在半夜2:30 Am，睡時身溫正常（不熱）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 二點半醒來與一點鐘醒來的定義不一樣。若一點鐘準時醒來是肝癌；二點   多醒則不是，身體在轉變。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好；一天2~3次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4. 口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5. 手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足稍冷。小腿時出青筋"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6. 精神："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體力尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7. 身痛："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圍繞肋一圈很緊繃，是持續的。     "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 疼痛處為陰實之處。持續發生是陰實的症狀，偶爾發生則沒關係。        陽維脈痛。疼痛處正為陰陽交接的地方。堅如盤，胸中大氣無法轉動。        陰陽大氣轉動時受阻。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8. 咽喉："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喉中時有痰阻；仍有一點咳嗽"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9. 眼："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左眼仍稍紅，眼屎較多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11. 其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小腿時出青筋。         癌症指數以近乎正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃脈稍洪數"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 現節氣值小滿，夏天要有符合夏天的脈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃乾"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→原本心有血及心有氣，舌應很潤澤生動的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"現因心臟受損，舌凹且乾。心陰受損，我們要將津液補足。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"而陰會喪失是因為陽受損。是故陰陽要平衡，相互有制衡的關係。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因此用藥上除心陰要補足外，也要將心陽護住。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（舌不可太大，舌頭太大是血虛）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有裂紋"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 病人進步中 肺中及乳房陰實漸退 但仍受阻於肺肝之間"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 大黃片 三片 泡茶喝 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 眼紅、眼屎較多。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 射干麻黃湯的加減"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桔梗5   炙甘草2   麻黃3     射干3    紫菀3  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"調腸胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬花3   半夏2     五味子3   細辛2 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 咳嗽；五味子止咳非常好 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乾薑2     桂枝4     炮附子3   大棗2   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 在陰陽大氣運轉時，用桂枝湯去芍藥加麻黃附子細辛湯 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 此方為複方：射干麻黃湯 合 桂枝湯去芍藥加麻黃附子細辛湯   "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"400 caps  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8×3   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三餐前服用"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 胸為陽，背為陰。當背部亦出現腫瘤時為陽入陰；以三焦系統而言，為三焦進入心包，皆很危險，會致命的。因此乳癌病人除注意內臟外，還要注意乳癌是否長到背後來。如一位香港來的乳癌病人，原先乳癌長到背後來，現吃藥則退回去。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 病人要多運動以刺激“陽”的生長，多出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 肺喜暖，讓身體多處於溫暖的地方。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"4. 炮附子能護心陽，但當裡寒盛要用生附將裡寒去掉。發生心臟衰竭時，要用生附子才有效。李可用治心臟衰竭，炮附子用到二、三百公克，若用生附三錢即可救醒病患。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"5. 女子停經後，一定要保持大便一天1~2次。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"6. 當睡眠品質變好、胃口好、足溫、大便正常則將一切安好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二星期藥服完後，再以傳真告知病情及症狀變化以調整藥物。"}]}]}]}]}